d <xref ref-type="fig" rid="fig1">1(c)</xref>; a marked tumor shrinkage was seen (tumor size: 9 &#x000d7; 8&#x02009;mm).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="CRIM.ENDOCRINOLOGY2013-634349.002"/></fig><table-wrap id="tab1" orientation="portrait" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Main clinical, laboratory, and instrumental findings.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="2" colspan="1">Parameters </th><th align="center" colspan="2" rowspan="1">35-year-old female patient <break/></th></tr><tr><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Baseline</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1-Year Follow-up<sup>1</sup></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Prolactin, PRL (mIU/mL)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10&#x02009;610</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">295</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Macroprolactin, MPRL (mIU/mL)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10&#x02009;107</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">106</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Recovery, %</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.7%</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">36%</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Tumor size (mm) (on MRI)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">21 &#x000d7; 13&#x02009;mm</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">9 &#x000d7; 8&#x02009;mm</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Body mass index, BMI (kg/m<sup>2</sup>)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">31.2%</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">28.6%</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Main patient's complaints </td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Severe headache; blurred vision </td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">No headache; normal vision </td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Hirsutism, Ferriman-Gallwey 